{"parse": {"title": "AFF-08", "pageid": 123504, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-07\" title=\"AFF-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFF-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-09\" title=\"AFF-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B3.95.E5.85.B0.E8.A5.BF.E4.B9.8B.E8.93.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"法兰西之蓝\">法兰西之蓝</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 法兰西之蓝</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The French Blue</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>言<span class=\"color-value\"></span>称<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>历<span class=\"color-value\"></span>史<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>回<span class=\"color-value\"></span>环<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3210108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_74_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_74_zone\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_74_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3f/Cg-3_2_at_74_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"467\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"432\" data-file-height=\"336\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>关于重塑之手，你当时了解多少？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谈话室中，一叠照片被推到了阿黛拉的面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>一个觉得神秘学家高人类一等的密教组织，仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>这个说法让他们听起来无害太多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>挑动争端、吸纳信众、谋划战争……重塑之手不会放过任何制造混乱的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>他们会将自己的力量渗透到每一个角落，你所在的时代也不例外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>黄金黎明会、无头、各种各样的蔷薇十字会后继者，甚至卡尔·荣格与西格蒙德·弗洛伊德都自觉或不自觉地与他们有所往来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>——你也一样，在巴黎时你应该也和重塑之手接触过。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_18\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_2_at_18.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_2_at_18.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_2_at_18.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一面黑色的镜子被摆在了桌上，蒙了雾一样的镜面模糊地映出阿黛拉的面容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>你接下来的发言至关重要，我们会用这个确认你的话是否属实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>灰调蓝小姐，你是否同意？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……我同意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她打量镜中面目模糊的自己，下意识抚摸着另一只手的手背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>其实我至今也认为，我应该没有招惹过什么重塑之手……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>现在我们正要弄清这一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>这是你画的当时出现在你手上的项链，没错吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张铅笔画替换掉了那叠照片，纸张上的笔触略显生涩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的指尖点向项链上缀着的那枚硕大的钻石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>你声称上面的钻石是法兰西之蓝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉的回答没有半分迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>……据说是世界上最美丽的蓝钻石，法兰西之蓝。<br />每一个曾拥有过它的人最终都厄运缠身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>法国经济崩溃，太阳王在晚年光辉尽失。然后是路易十五死于天花，最后洪水滔天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>至于像蒙特斯庞夫人、尼古拉·富凯、叶卡捷琳娜二世、乔治四世、托马斯·霍普那些人的故事，你应该比我更熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>毕竟最初将它带回法国的，就是塔沃尼尔家的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>是啊，从小我听过无数关于这枚钻石的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">执夜人：</div><div>那你应该清楚，你不可能拿到它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……我明白你的意思，执夜人先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>早在一个世纪前，法兰西之蓝就被重新切割，不复存在了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>现在它留下的最大的那一块叫做希望钻石，最多只有曾经一半的风采。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>但执夜人先生，那个时候我只能得出这个结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她迎上对方满是怀疑的目光，镜中的影像并未发生任何谎言招致的扭曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>那枚钻石只可能是法兰西之蓝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有时钟的响声在水晶工房的会客室内回响。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-313521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-313521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-313521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你已经看了三个小时了，阿黛拉小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宝石鉴定专家保持着仰头的姿势，抛开手部翻弄钻石的动作，她已经与雕塑无异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……真的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>没有一点伪造痕迹，绝对不是仿品，重量大概有60……70……67克拉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>外形也和家族图谱上记载的一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>难道麦克林夫人的希望钻石是假货？真正的法兰西之蓝其实一直在它的发现者，塔沃尼尔家族内流传？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>——怎么可能有这种天方夜谭！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她放下那颗钻石，有些崩溃地向占卜师提出质疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您究竟想干什么？找来这么大一颗蓝钻对我恶作剧？这就是您说的净化仪式？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>您如果坚持这是我的，那我可就拿走了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>阿黛拉小姐，水晶工房不出售钻石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我和你同样确信它不属于自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>法兰西之蓝早就是历史了！它已经被切割成希望钻石，不再存于世！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>可你刚刚才确认过。它货真价实，此刻就在你的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话题回到了原点，宝石鉴定专家只能看着眼前切实的证据不知所措。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我不明白……我梦见西莉亚把它给了我，然后它就真的到了我手上……<br />但梦中的事物怎么会现实化……？而且连触感都这么真实？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>梦境往往更能示人以真。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔的面色依然平静，就像在谈论理所应当之事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>按照卡巴拉主义者的观点，物质世界只是完全的灵性在经过精神四世界时不断劣化的最终结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>任何物质都是其精神的劣化，其消亡也无法反馈到精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>只要精神仍存在，经由灵性的再次流溢而回归物质世界也并非不可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你握在手上的，或许正是再次物质化的精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师的分享无懈可击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这番话只让年轻的司机更加糊涂了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不可能，梦就是梦，怎么会成真？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她攥紧了拳头，尝试分辨这是否是另一个梦——但除了一些不必要的疼痛外，毫无结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>如果它能成真，为什么只有钻石“物质化”了，我醒来却没有见到西莉亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>该死……真像是亲人去世前会做的那种晦气的梦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉懊恼地拍了一下脑门，开始与梦中逻辑进行无谓的缠斗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，某种更为具体的担忧占了上风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我得去找西莉亚……我有种不好的预感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>就算这枚古怪的钻石真的从梦里来到了现实中，在搞清楚它和西莉亚的关系前，我也不能就这么听从一个梦的指示烧毁它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她按住了幼龙刚刚对准钻石的脑袋，思考起好友可能的位置来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我应该去学校？不，西莉亚可能在外面调研。干脆，去她家里堵她……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她望着店里的水晶，忽地意识到眼前正有一条捷径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……对了，贝丽尔女士。您能占卜出西莉亚现在的位置吗？<br />就用她给我的钻石——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>很遗憾，阿黛拉小姐，虽然这枚钻石的质地非常纯粹，它提供的视野却并非如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>要想找到你的朋友，最好是提供她曾长期持有的、寄有感情的物件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那我立刻回家里一趟找找看！请您在这里等我……最多半个小时！<br />我是开车来的，这不费多少时间——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宝石鉴定专家差点就要夺门而出。<br />占卜师轻抚了一下裙摆，也随之站了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>抱歉，阿黛拉小姐，我今天要关门了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>呃——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人所有的急切都扑到了空气中，她尴尬地张开了嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>——但我并不介意在回去的路上，坐你的车绕上一小段路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉反应了半天，随即雀跃起来，热情地为占卜师拉开了大门。<br />对她来说，这无疑是一个好得多的方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>真不好意思，让您特意和我走一趟……<br />对了，您还没有告诉我占卜的费用呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>不必在意。我说过，那扇门为你而开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>命运会把你的报酬在合适的时机支付给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我没太弄明白……您这句话，是说您的老板是“命运”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>命运是我的老板……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>司机惊讶地看见，自己随口的俏皮话竟真令贝丽尔思考了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……嗯，你是第一位从这个角度阐释的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师得体地微笑着，关上了水晶工房的门扉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>现在先让我们出发吧。为了你的朋友，还有我的“老板”。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFF-08"}}